      "content": "Okay, that makes sense. The problem is that the rule-based engine is significantly lighter on resources because it won't be doing all that heavy matrix multiplication or RNN math—it just follows set logic. My concern is whether that loss in depth is going to mess with the actual logistics. If we swap your optimization layer for something that just uses heuristics, what kind of impact are we looking at for the global supply chain efficiency? Is there a risk of missing the kind of edge-case optimizations you're currently handling?",
